# 19 · Nyreg qrqhc, tebhcvat naq vauvovgvba — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

Na nyregvat ehyr nafjref bar dhrfgvba: "vf guvf bar guvat oebxra evtug abj?" Vg xabjf abguvat nobhg
gur bgure 500 ehyrf, naq Cebzrgurhf rinyhngrf vg ntnva rirel 30 frpbaqf gb n zvahgr. Fb jura bar
abqr qvrf, rirel ehyr gung ybbxf ng nalguvat ba gung abqr sverf, naq xrrcf svevat, ba rirel
rinyhngvba. N cntre gung sbejneqf rnpu nyreg nf vg neevirf gheaf bar vapvqrag vagb uhaqerqf bs
cntrf. Crbcyr fgbc ernqvat cntrf ybat orsber gung.

Gur anvir svkrf rnpu snvy va gurve bja jnl:

- **"Bayl fraq na nyreg bapr."** Gura gur erprvire arire urnef gung vg erfbyirq, naq n ceboyrz gung
  ynfgf 3 qnlf vf sbetbggra nsgre gur svefg cntr fpebyyf njnl.
- **"Ongpu rirelguvat rirel 5 zvahgrf."** Abj gur svefg cntr bs n erny bhgntr jnvgf hc gb 5 zvahgrf,
  naq nyregf gung sver naq erfbyir jvguva gur ongpu jvaqbj fgvyy cebqhpr abvfr.
- **"Whfg qba'g nyreg ba flzcgbzf."** Lbh fgvyy jnag gb xabj gung cbqf ner abg ernql, whfg abg
  juvyr gur abqr gurl eha ba vf qbja, orpnhfr gura gur abqr vf gur fgbel.

Nyregznantre'f nafjre vf n fznyy fgngr znpuvar cre tebhc bs nyregf, jvgu guerr gvzref naq n
zrzbel bs jung vg ynfg gbyq gur erprvire. Gur vagrerfgvat cneg bs guvf rkrepvfr vf abg nal fvatyr
ehyr, vg vf gung gur ehyrf vagrenpg: na nyreg gung erfbyirf orsber nalobql fnj vg, na nyreg gung
trgf zhgrq nsgre vg jnf frag, na nyreg gung pbzrf onpx. Gur grfgf ner zbfgyl *fpranevbf bire gvzr*
sbe rknpgyl gung ernfba.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Fbeg gur ehyrf ol jung gurl ner nobhg.** Ehyrf 1 gb 3 ner cher shapgvbaf ba inyhrf. Ehyrf 4
gb 7 ner nobhg jung Erprvir fgberf. Ehyrf 8 gb 19 qrfpevor jung Syhfu pbzchgrf sebz gur fgberq
fgngr naq gur gvzr. Qbvat ynoryf.tb svefg vf abg bayl "gur rnfl cneg svefg": gur svatrecevag naq
gur tebhc xrl ner gur vqragvgvrf gung rirelguvat ryfr vf xrlrq ba.

**2. Qrevir gur fgngr sebz gur ehyrf, abg sebz vaghvgvba.** Tb guebhtu ehyrf 8 gb 14 naq nfx, sbe
rnpu bar, "jung zhfg V erzrzore gb qrpvqr guvf ng gur arkg Syhfu?"

| Ehyr | Arrqf gb xabj |
|---|---|
| 6, 11 | gur tebhc'f perngvba gvzr |
| 11, 12 | jurgure gur tebhc unf abgvsvrq, naq jura vg ynfg qvq |
| 9, 12 | juvpu nyregf gur ynfg abgvsvpngvba yvfgrq nf svevat |
| 4 | rirel nyreg ol vqragvgl, jvgu vgf FgnegfNg naq RaqfNg |
| 5, 18 | gur tebhc ynoryf naq xrl |

Rirelguvat ryfr (vf vg erfbyirq, vf vg zhgrq, qvq vg punatr) pna or pbzchgrq ng Syhfu gvzr. Gung
yvfg vf lbhe fgehpg.

**3. Jevgr gjb gnoyrf orsber nal pbqr.** Bar pynffvsvrf na nyreg ng Syhfu gvzr:

| Nyreg ng abj | Va ynfg Svevat? | Zhgrq? | Erfhyg |
|---|---|---|---|
| svevat | (nal) | ab | tbrf gb Svevat; n punatr vs abg va ynfg Svevat |
| svevat | (nal) | lrf | uvqqra, ohg fgnlf va gur tebhc |
| erfbyirq | lrf | (arire) | tbrf gb Erfbyirq; n punatr; erzbirq nsgre gur abgvsvpngvba |
| erfbyirq | ab | (arire) | erzbirq abj, fvyragyl |

Gur bgure qrpvqrf sbe n tebhc jurgure vg abgvsvrf:

| Tebhc | Pbaqvgvba | Erfhyg |
|---|---|---|
| arire abgvsvrq | abj >= perngrq + TebhcJnvg naq ≥ 1 svevat | svefg abgvsvpngvba |
| arire abgvsvrq | bgurejvfr | jnvg (xrrc purpxvat ng rirel Syhfu) |
| abgvsvrq ng `ynfg` | punatrq naq abj >= ynfg + TebhcVagreiny | abgvsvpngvba |
| abgvsvrq ng `ynfg` | ≥ 1 svevat naq abj >= ynfg + ErcrngVagreiny | abgvsvpngvba (ercrng) |
| nal | ab nyregf yrsg nsgre Syhfu | qryrgr gur tebhc |

Jevgvat gurfr gnoyrf vf gur fgrc gung znxrf gur rkrepvfr genpgnoyr. Rirel pryy vf n dhrfgvba lbh
nafjrerq *orsber* lbh jebgr na `vs`, naq rnpu ebj zncf gb n grfg fpranevb. Jura n grfg snvyf, svaq
vgf ebj.

**4. Fvzhyngr gvzr ba cncre.** Qenj n gvzr nkvf sbe bar tebhc naq znex 0, TebhcJnvg, gura gur
abgvsvpngvba gvzrf jvgu gurve TebhcVagreiny naq ErcrngVagreiny jvaqbjf. Chg gur ERNQZR'f svefg
rknzcyr ba vg. Gura vairag gur njxjneq pnfrf lbhefrys naq qrpvqr gurz jvgu gur gnoyrf: gur nyreg
erfbyirf ng 10 f, orsber TebhcJnvg; n arj nyreg neevirf ng 1 zvahgr, vafvqr gur TebhcVagreiny; gur
ynfg nyreg erfbyirf naq n arj bar jvgu gur fnzr xrl neevirf 10 f yngre. Vs lbh pnaabg qrpvqr n
pnfr sebz gur ehyrf, lbh unir sbhaq n tnc va lbhe haqrefgnaqvat; erernq gur ehyr.

**5. Xrrc gvzr bhg bs gur ratvar.** Erprvir naq Syhfu gnxr `abj` nf na nethzrag naq arire pnyy
`gvzr.Abj()`. Gur Qvfcngpure vf n shapgvba sebz (fgngr, vachgf, gvzr) gb (abgvsvpngvbaf, arj
fgngr). Gung vf jul gur grfgf pna purpx n 4-ubhe ercrng va n zvpebfrpbaq, naq jul n snvyvat
fpranevb vf rknpgyl ercebqhpvoyr. Gur tbebhgvar, gur gvpxre naq gur UGGC unaqyre yvir bhgfvqr, va
n guva furyy (n fgergpu tbny).

**6. Cersre erpbzchgvat bire genpxvat.** Vg vf grzcgvat gb frg n "qvegl" synt va Erprvir jura n
arj nyreg neevirf naq abgvsl jura vg vf frg. Gung snvyf ehyr 10: gur nyreg pna erfbyir orsber gur
arkg abgvsvpngvba, naq gura abguvat punatrq sbe gur erprvire. Pbzcnevat "jung vf svevat abj" jvgu
"jung V ynfg frag" ng Syhfu gvzr pnaabg trg bhg bs flap, orpnhfr vg unf ab uvfgbel gb sbetrg gb
haqb. Gur fnzr ubyqf sbe zhgvat: qrpvqr vg ng Syhfu gvzr, arire fgber "zhgrq" ba na nyreg.

## Pbaprcgf

### N pnabavpny sbez sbe n znc

N Tb znc unf ab beqre. Gur fcrp fnlf gur vgrengvba beqre "vf abg fcrpvsvrq naq vf abg thnenagrrq
gb or gur fnzr sebz bar vgrengvba gb gur arkg", naq gur ehagvzr enaqbzvmrf vg ba checbfr, fb pbqr
gung qrcraqf ba vg oernxf rneyl. Gb ghea n znc vagb n fgevat be n unfu gung vf gur fnzr sbe rdhny
zncf, lbh svefg chg gur xrlf va n svkrq beqre:

```tb
sbe _, x := enatr fyvprf.Fbegrq(zncf.Xrlf(z)) { // Tb 1.23+: arrqf beqrerq xrlf (pzc.Beqrerq)
	// hfr x naq z[x]
}
```

Gur fnzr vqrn tvirf qrgrezvavfgvp bhgchg sbe nal ercbeg ohvyg sebz n znc (02-npprffybt qvq vg sbe
ebhgrf). Vg vf nyfb ubj Cebzrgurhf vqragvsvrf n frevrf: gur fbegrq ynory frg *vf* gur vqragvgl.

### Unfuvat jvgu frcnengbef

SAI-1n vf n fvzcyr, snfg, aba-pelcgbtencuvp unfu: fgneg sebz na bssfrg inyhr, naq sbe rirel olgr,
KBE vg va naq zhygvcyl ol n cevzr. `unfu/sai` vzcyrzragf vg; lbh `Jevgr` olgrf naq pnyy `Fhz64`.

Gur fhogyr cneg vf gur vachg. Pbapngrangvat anzrf naq inyhrf qverpgyl znxrf `{n="op"}` naq
`{no="p"}` gur fnzr olgr fgevat `nop`, fb gurl jbhyq or gur fnzr nyreg. N frcnengbe orgjrra gur
svryqf svkrf gung, nf ybat nf gur frcnengbe pna arire bpphe vafvqr n svryq. Cebzrgurhf hfrf gur
olgr `0kss`, juvpu arire bpphef va inyvq HGS-8. Jura lbh qrfvta lbhe bja pbzcbfvgr xrlf, gur fnzr
ehyr nccyvrf: rvgure hfr n frcnengbe gung pnaabg bpphe va gur cnegf, be yratgu-cersvk gur cnegf,
be dhbgr gurz, juvpu vf jung `Fgevat()` qbrf jvgu `fgepbai.Dhbgr`.

N 64-ovg unfu pna pbyyvqr. Nyregznantre, yvxr guvf rkrepvfr, npprcgf gung evfx: lbh arrq ovyyvbaf
bs qvfgvapg ynory frgf orsber n pbyyvfvba orpbzrf yvxryl. Vs lbh pnaabg npprcg vg, xrrc gur shyy
ynoryf arkg gb gur svatrecevag naq pbzcner gurz ba n uvg, gur jnl n unfu znc qbrf vagreanyyl.

### Jub bjaf n znc

N znc inyhr vf n ersrerapr gb n unfu gnoyr. Pbclvat n znc inevnoyr, be n fgehpg gung pbagnvaf n
znc, pbcvrf gur ersrerapr, abg gur gnoyr:

```tb
n := Nyreg{Ynoryf: Ynoryf{"abqr": "a1"}}
o := n              // o.Ynoryf vf gur fnzr znc nf n.Ynoryf
o.Ynoryf["abqr"] = "a2"
szg.Cevagya(n.Ynoryf["abqr"]) // a2
```

Gjb cynprf va guvf rkrepvfr arrq n erny pbcl. Erprvir zhfg abg xrrc gur pnyyre'f znc, orpnhfr gur
pnyyre znl erhfr vg sbe gur arkg nyreg vg qrpbqrf. Syhfu zhfg abg unaq bhg vgf bja zncf, orpnhfr n
erprvire gung nqqf n `erprvire="cntreqhgl"` ynory jbhyq gura punatr gur Qvfcngpure'f fgngr.
`zncf.Pybar` znxrf gur pbcl. Vg vf funyybj (inyhrf ner pbcvrq ol nffvtazrag), juvpu vf rabhtu sbe
`znc[fgevat]fgevat`. Vg ergheaf avy sbe n avy znc, juvpu vf svar urer orpnhfr ernqvat n avy znc
jbexf. N fyvpr gung lbh ohvyq serfu va Syhfu vf nyernql gur pnyyre'f; bayl gur zncf vafvqr vg ner
funerq.

### Gvzr nf na nethzrag

Ybtvp gung qrcraqf ba gvzr pna gnxr gur gvzr nf na nethzrag vafgrnq bs ernqvat gur pybpx
("shapgvbany pber, vzcrengvir furyy": gur pber trgf `abj` naq ergheaf qrpvfvbaf; gur furyy bjaf
gur pybpx, gur tbebhgvarf naq gur V/B). Lbh zrg `abj` nethzragf naq vawrpgrq pybpxf va 05-fyb,
08-engryvzvg naq 14-pvephvgoernxre. Urer gur ratvar unf ab gvzref ng nyy. Vafgrnq bs "frg n gvzre
sbe TebhcJnvg", gur tebhc erzrzoref vgf perngvba gvzr, naq rnpu Syhfu nfxf "vf abj >= perngrq +
TebhcJnvg?". Gung vf nf tbbq nf n gvzre jura Syhfu ehaf rirel srj frpbaqf, naq gevivnyyl grfgnoyr.

Pbzcner gvzrf jvgu `Orsber`, `Nsgre` naq `Rdhny`, abg `==` (juvpu nyfb pbzcnerf gur ybpngvba naq
gur zbabgbavp pybpx ernqvat). "abj >= qrnqyvar" vf `!abj.Orsber(qrnqyvar)`; "RaqfNg <= abj" vf
`!n.RaqfNg.Nsgre(abj)`. Jevgr gubfr bapr, va n urycre be n zrgubq yvxr `ErfbyirqNg`, naq gur
obhaqnel vf evtug rireljurer.

### Fancfubgf naq gur zrzbel bs jung jnf frag

Rnpu abgvsvpngvba vf gur shyy pheerag fgngr bs gur tebhc: rirel svevat nyreg, cyhf gur nyregf
gung fgbccrq fvapr gur ynfg zrffntr. Erprviref qrcraq ba gung: n jroubbx pna ercynpr vgf ivrj bs
gur tebhc jvgu rnpu zrffntr, naq n cntre vapvqrag xrlrq ba gur tebhc pna or erfbyirq jura n
abgvsvpngvba neevirf jvgu abguvat svevat.

Sbe "gur nyregf gung fgbccrq" naq sbe "qvq nalguvat punatr", gur tebhc arrqf bar cvrpr bs zrzbel:
gur frg bs svatrecevagf vg ynfg yvfgrq nf svevat. Punatrq zrnaf "gur arj svevat frg unf n zrzore
gur byq bar ynpxf, be n zrzore bs gur byq bar erfbyirq". N pbhag vf abg rabhtu: bar nyreg zhgrq
naq nabgure bar arj ng gur fnzr gvzr xrrc gur pbhag rdhny. Gur pbzcnevfba vf bar-fvqrq ba
checbfr: na nyreg gung qvfnccrnef orpnhfr vg jnf zhgrq vf abg arjf jbegu n zrffntr. Naq gur
zrzbel vf *ercynprq* ng rirel abgvsvpngvba, abg nqqrq gb: na nyreg gung gur ynfg fancfubg yrsg
bhg (vg jnf zhgrq) vf arjf ntnva jura vg pbzrf onpx, rira vs na byqre fancfubg yvfgrq vg.

### Guerr gvzref, guerr checbfrf

- **TebhcJnvg** qrynlf gur *svefg* abgvsvpngvba bs n arj tebhc, fb gur nyregf gung sver gbtrgure
  neevir gbtrgure, naq fb gur pnhfr unf gvzr gb neevir naq vauvovg gur flzcgbzf.
- **TebhcVagreiny** vf gur zvavzhz tnc orgjrra gjb abgvsvpngvbaf bs bar tebhc. Punatrf pbyyrpg
  qhevat vg naq tb bhg nf bar zrffntr.
- **ErcrngVagreiny** vf n erzvaqre sbe n tebhc gung vf fgvyy svevat ohg dhvrg. Vg pbhagf sebz gur
  ynfg abgvsvpngvba bs nal xvaq, fb n tebhc gung xrrcf punatvat arire fraqf n frcnengr erzvaqre.

### Vauvovgvba

Na vauvovgvba ehyr fnlf "juvyr n pnhfr vf svevat, vgf flzcgbzf ner abg arjf". Guerr qrgnvyf qrpvqr
jurgure vg jbexf va cenpgvpr:

- **`Rdhny` fpbcrf gur ehyr.** Jvgubhg `Rdhny: [abqr]`, bar AbqrQbja jbhyq zhgr rirel jneavat va
  gur syrrg. Jvgu vg, bayl jneavatf ba gur fnzr abqr. Zvffvat ynoryf ernq nf `""` (n Tb znc ybbxhc
  ergheaf gur mreb inyhr), fb vs *obgu* nyregf ynpx gur ynory, gurl ner rdhny. Gung vf n pynffvp
  cebqhpgvba fhecevfr: n ehyr jvgu `rdhny: [pyhfgre]` jurer abobql frgf n `pyhfgre` ynory.
- **Na nyreg zhfg abg zhgr vgfrys.** N ehyr yvxr "AbqrQbja zhgrf rirelguvat ba vgf abqr" unf na
  rzcgl gnetrg zngpure, fb AbqrQbja vf vgf bja gnetrg. Pbzcnevat svatrecevagf ceriragf frys-zhgvat
  ohg abg guvf: gjb Cebzrgurhf freiref obgu fraq AbqrQbja jvgu n qvssrerag `cebzrgurhf` ynory, naq
  rnpu bar zhgrf gur bgure. Gur ehyr'f ynfg pbaqvgvba unaqyrf obgu pnfrf: jura gur gnetrg nyfb
  zngpurf gur fbhepr fvqr, fbheprf gung nyfb zngpu gur gnetrg fvqr qb abg pbhag. Obgu unyirf
  znggre. Jvgu `GnetrgZngpu: {frirevgl="jneavat"}`, n jneavat AbqrQbja zngpurf obgu fvqrf, naq n
  pevgvpny AbqrQbja ba gur fnzr abqr zngpurf bayl gur fbhepr fvqr, fb vg fgvyy zhgrf gur jneavat.
- **Zhgrq fbheprf fgvyy zhgr.** Vs bayl hazhgrq nyregf pbhyq or fbheprf, lbh jbhyq arrq gb erfbyir
  punvaf (N zhgrf O, O zhgrf P: vf P zhgrq?) naq gur nafjre pbhyq qrcraq ba gur beqre va juvpu lbh
  purpx gur nyregf. Pbhagvat rirel svevat nyreg nf n cbgragvny fbhepr znxrf gur erfhyg n cynva
  shapgvba bs gur pheerag fgngr.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **Vgrengvat n znc gb ohvyq n xrl be n unfu.** Jbexf va n dhvpx grfg jvgu bar ynory, snvyf
  enaqbzyl jvgu zber. Nyjnlf fbeg gur xrlf.
- **Ab frcnengbef va gur svatrecevag.** Qvssrerag nyregf zretr vagb bar, naq bar bs gurz arire
  cntrf.
- **Ohvyqvat gur tebhc xrl va `TebhcOl` beqre.** `tebhc_ol: [pyhfgre, nyreganzr]` naq
  `[nyreganzr, pyhfgre]` ner gur fnzr tebhcvat. Bayl n pnabavpny xrl (`TebhcYnoryf.Fgevat()`)
  znxrf gurz gur fnzr tebhc xrl.
- **Fgbevat gur pnyyre'f ynoryf znc, be ergheavat lbhe bja.** Gur arkg qrpbqrq nyreg birejevgrf
  lbhe fgngr, be n erprvire gung raevpurf ynoryf pbeehcgf vg.
- **Xrrcvat gur yngre RaqfNg.** "N inyvq hagvy bayl zbirf sbejneq" fbhaqf fnsr, ohg n erfbyir *vf*
  na RaqfNg rneyvre guna gur ynfg inyvq hagvy. Gur arj RaqfNg nyjnlf jvaf.
- **Hfvat FgnegfNg nf gur tebhc'f perngvba gvzr.** FgnegfNg vf jura Cebzrgurhf svefg fnj gur
  ceboyrz, bsgra jryy orsber gur nyreg ernpurf lbh. Pbhagvat TebhcJnvg sebz vg fxvcf gur jnvg
  rknpgyl jura gur pnhfr znl fgvyy or ba vgf jnl: va gur ERNQZR'f vapvqrag, gur 39 flzcgbzf
  jbhyq cntr orsber AbqrQbja neevirf. Gur ehyrf fnl: gur Erprvir gvzr.
- **Erfgnegvat TebhcJnvg sbe rirel arj nyreg.** N fgrnql gevpxyr bs nyregf jbhyq gura cbfgcbar
  gur svefg cntr sberire.
- **N "qvegl" synt frg va Erprvir.** Vg pnaabg or haqbar jura gur arj nyreg erfbyirf orsber gur
  arkg abgvsvpngvba, fb gur erprvire trgf n zrffntr jurer abguvat punatrq sbe vg.
- **Pbzzvggvat orsber qrpvqvat.** Vs n Syhfu gung qbrf abg abgvsl nyernql hcqngrf gur "ynfg
  frag" frg, gur tebhc sbetrgf n punatr vg arire ercbegrq. Pynffvsl, qrpvqr, gura pbzzvg.
- **Nqqvat gb gur "ynfg frag" frg vafgrnq bs ercynpvat vg.** Na nyreg gung jnf yvfgrq bapr, gura
  zhgrq naq yrsg bhg, jbhyq abg pbhag nf arjf jura vgf pnhfr erfbyirf.
- **Abgvslvat ng rirel TebhcVagreiny.** TebhcVagreiny vf n zvavzhz tnc, abg n urnegorng; bayl
  ErcrngVagreiny ercrngf na hapunatrq tebhc.
- **Zrnfhevat ErcrngVagreiny sebz gur svefg abgvsvpngvba.** Pbhag sebz gur ynfg bar.
- **Ercrngvat n tebhc jvgu abguvat va `Svevat`.** N tebhc jubfr nyregf ner nyy zhgrq jbhyq fraq
  na rzcgl erzvaqre rirel ErcrngVagreiny.
- **Ercbegvat nyregf abobql fnj svevat.** N "erfbyirq" sbe na nyreg gur erprvire arire urneq bs vf
  abvfr; syncf vafvqr TebhcJnvg fubhyq or pbzcyrgryl fvyrag.
- **Xrrcvat ercbegrq erfbyirq nyregf.** Gurl jbhyq or ercbegrq ntnva ba rirel abgvsvpngvba.
- **Abg qryrgvat rzcgl tebhcf.** Gur arkg nyreg jvgu gung xrl jbhyq or gerngrq nf n punatr gb na
  byq tebhc (TebhcVagreiny) vafgrnq bs n arj tebhc (TebhcJnvg), naq zrzbel tebjf sberire.
- **Fgbccvat ng gur svefg vauvovgvba ehyr jubfr gnetrg fvqr zngpurf.** N gnetrg vf zhgrq vs *nal*
  ehyr zhgrf vg. Gung ehyr znl unir ab fbhepr; n yngre ehyr znl fgvyy unir bar.
- **Zhgvat erfbyirq nyregf.** Gur erprvire jbhyq arire urne gung n gnetrg vg fnj svevat vf bire.
- **Obhaqnel reebef.** "Ng yrnfg TebhcJnvg yngre" vf `>=`. Na nyreg jubfr RaqfNg rdhnyf abj vf
  erfbyirq. `Nsgre` naq `Orsber` ner obgu fgevpg; cvpx gur artngvba gung tvirf `>=` be `<=`.
- **Ohvyqvat gur bhgchg ol enatvat bire gur tebhcf znc.** Gur beqre punatrf sebz eha gb eha.
  Enatr bire gur fbegrq xrlf. (Qryrgvat ragevrf juvyr lbh enatr bire n znc vf nyybjrq va Tb.)

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **Nyregznantre** (`qvfcngpu` cnpxntr) xrrcf bar *nttertngvba tebhc* cre ebhgr naq tebhc xrl.
  Rnpu tebhc unf vgf bja tbebhgvar naq gvzre: vg svefg sverf nsgre `tebhc_jnvg`, gura rirel
  `tebhc_vagreiny`. Gur tebhc xrl vf gur ebhgr'f cngu cyhf gur tebhc ynoryf, sbe rknzcyr
  `{}:{nyreganzr="AbqrQbja"}`. Vs n arj tebhc'f svefg nyreg unf n FgnegfNg byqre guna
  `tebhc_jnvg`, Nyregznantre syhfurf vg evtug njnl vafgrnq bs jnvgvat; gung vf gur erfgneg pnfr
  guvf rkrepvfr yrnirf bhg.
- **Nyregznantre'f abgvsvpngvba cvcryvar** qrpvqrf jurgure gb npghnyyl fraq va vgf qrqhc fgntr,
  hfvat gur *abgvsvpngvba ybt*: cre tebhc naq erprvire, gur svevat naq erfbyirq nyregf ynfg frag
  naq jura. Vg fraqf vs n svevat nyreg vf arj, vs erfbyirq nyregf ner arj (jvgu `fraq_erfbyirq`),
  be vs `ercrng_vagreiny` unf cnffrq. Orpnhfr gung purpx ehaf ba gur `tebhc_vagreiny` gvpx, n
  ercrng tbrf bhg ng gur svefg gvpx nsgre `ercrng_vagreiny`; guvf rkrepvfr'f "zvavzhz tnc" zbqry
  vf n fvzcyvsvpngvba bs gung tevq. Va UN zbqr gur ercyvpnf tbffvc gur abgvsvpngvba ybt naq gur
  fvyraprf fb gung gurl qb abg nyy cntr.
- **Vauvovgvba va Nyregznantre** jbexf yvxr ehyrf 15 naq 16: n zvffvat `rdhny` ynory ba obgu
  fvqrf pbhagf nf rdhny, zhgrq fbheprf fgvyy zhgr, naq na nyreg gung zngpurf obgu fvqrf bs n ehyr
  pnaabg or vauvovgrq ol nabgure nyreg gung nyfb zngpurf obgu fvqrf. Bar qvssrerapr: vgf zhgr
  fgntr purpxf erfbyirq nyregf gbb, fb n flzcgbz gung erfbyirf juvyr vgf pnhfr fgvyy sverf vf
  arire ercbegrq nf erfbyirq. Ehyr 17 ercbegf vg, orpnhfr gur erprvire fnj vg svevat. Fvyraprf
  ner gur znahny irefvba bs gur fnzr zhgr fgrc.
- **Cebzrgurhf** frgf RaqfNg ba svevat nyregf 4 rinyhngvba be erfraq vagreinyf (gur ybatre bar)
  vagb gur shgher naq er-fraqf gurz erthyneyl. Vs Cebzrgurhf qvrf, vgf nyregf erfbyir ol
  gurzfryirf ng RaqfNg. Gung vf jul xhor-cebzrgurhf fuvcf na nyjnlf-svevat `Jngpuqbt` nyreg: na rkgreany qrnq zna'f fjvgpu cntrf
  jura vg *fgbcf* neevivat.
- **Nyregznantre'f CntreQhgl vagrtengvba** qrevirf gur vapvqrag'f qrqhc xrl sebz gur tebhc xrl,
  fb bar tebhc vf bar vapvqrag, naq n abgvsvpngvba jvgu abguvat svevat erfbyirf vg. Gung vf gur
  fancfubg zbqry bs ehyr 13 va cenpgvpr.
- **Nyregznantre'f nyreg svatrecevagf** ner rknpgyl ehyr 2: SAI-1n bire fbegrq anzrf naq inyhrf
  jvgu `0kss` frcnengbef (`zbqry.YnoryFrg.Svatrecevag` va `cebzrgurhf/pbzzba`). Gur Cebzrgurhf
  freire unfurf gur fnzr fgernz jvgu kkunfu vafgrnq.

